<title>USA: 3COM, U.S. Robotics in $6.6 billion merger.</title>
<headline>3COM, U.S. Robotics in $6.6 billion merger.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer network power 3Com Corp. will buy modem giant U.S. Robotics in a deal valued at $6.6 billion, the companies announced on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The merger will create a company with more than $5 billion in annual revenues and more than 12,000 employees in 130 countries, they said.</p>
